30+00:00","text":"🪓 A Siberian dig may hold traces of an unknown Bronze Age culture At Karyer Tai-1 near Novosibirsk, an expedition led by academician Vyacheslav Molodin excavated a Bronze Age sanctuary, with campfire traces and casting-mould fragments in a ditch, and sacrificed sable and fox bones in the pits. A burial pit held a vessel matching the Petrovka culture, which lay hundreds of kilometres to the south-west, and a mould for casting a Seima-Turbino-type bronze celt. Palaeogenetics at the Institute of Cytology and Genetics linked the local Baraba population to newcomers from modern Kazakhstan. Molodin says this may be a new culture of the developed Bronze Age — still a hypothesis, with digging resuming in 2027. #archaeology #bronzeage #siberia @science","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/UUcVtDWfTj2sxy2qwkbmPaYgkGV902fbk7Opzbk-UYygZLqpzXm1NazcXocgItgZ-Y3XfBWex3XUs9y1cQ9DD0GSNSfxVmOKU753jIyln7vQxw9d8q8uNXfgWR8dhW9qwGcuCeVKDwkJk3IzRrL2AXHvYW_3N11ESlVXbiOaZALgyvfFjQM77YuqpetEyAGJws1Sx3rCVJ9FUTXhZ9cOfrUnmNpmGdGvPXvJkF3u8D4Jptek1Ay-SrrKh8XK3HGEA2w2CSONC6arifZxvoM72BVX7flWOLJWMzQmLsCfNvQR7n6lDAXDTkDEOhNm5mLkDcIuJ-BuSGo36oymgV-Ufg.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4532","date":"2026-11-13T07:10:46+00:00","text":"🧠 Some kids' math struggles may be about strategy, not numbers A Stanford University study published in JNeurosci suggests that children with developmental dyscalculia struggle not only with calculations but also with choosing how to approach a problem. Led by Oliver Lasnick, the team found that these children took longer to switch methods, were less responsive when difficulty changed, and — unlike other children — did not get better at choosing approaches over time. Brain activity in a particular system also differed between them and children more skilled at using strategies. The study followed 68 children between the ages of 8 and 10. The findings show differences in behavior and brain activity, not what causes them. #neuroscience #dyscalculia #childdevelopment @science","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/T-9J5U7hpSLJwCT7Xhq-HCmjbjdLX49msLpBPbvmsPaQv1mpAETooxWEy31UqA91Lg7oAmDZFCRSVFeqm6vPxaEzg7b7u8Hks6AgsCLrTttsKAbVtbOgHcdWvgdYdp-hnPk3QXDc7xKiCLY7JVPpn1uol3rTnuKPkALlWkfXRtMU7v-7-yKirNcQFIA_wQzPp7nnq04FBR3R55O8RAcPxlG3I3thAvVvT01Tl2Jvl6xl8KnWFySJ0yuKeSoHuqnQn_c6PUHXWlbnWIMTMImn55OJMUf2A1wsoRnFLhpskb7Kv0tz07WolFDt5hg19UNVNrDbZ5aMqUvtPNBoYTmjag.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4530","date":"2026-11-12T13:11:31+00:00","text":"","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/Lc6SrbEi6P9Jgz1leDCZy7GTQok6MtKz5OH9jXTJEWZ9MVSKTL24cUuGnWnGeBavZGZSltvAz3XD8XnfujZoVYpVET816EPFjpeY9GT0OiBQ-TzpdfsLNDtl9EYWH3oyFgFlvSUhDjMKVKcgBEV2Vuookw1kCbZxtRCLRdRxpXMBPmIViCnyb1tbanNhTZShKxFThZfPHasvmQQ-QKXN364kTBoF3tbgq_FV5qMZqwKmggjcQcE1FIH8lKFrTlFGhKto33sfUAAILW3XGq_089x28Dyg-LaeqXu2HYjGM5jlKygrDg8cV8rtnRl_4c3bcmP7V3PjNv_oRIKXIPKdxQ","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4529","date":"2026-11-12T13:08:42+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4528","date":"2026-11-12T13:08:41+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4527","date":"2026-11-12T13:07:46+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4526","date":"2026-11-12T13:01:32+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4525","date":"2026-11-12T11:02:56+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4524","date":"2026-11-12T07:32:04+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"4523","date":"2026-11-11T20:05:47+00:00","text":"","image":"","video":"","hasVideo":false}]
